LAW InventoryConservation
A completed purchase increases inventory by the registered purchased quantities exactly once.
A completed sale decreases inventory by the resolved sold quantities exactly once.

LAW FinancialCausality
Every purchase financial outflow references one registered purchase.
Every sale financial inflow references one completed sale.

LAW CompletionOrdering
PurchaseCompleted implies StockIncreased occurred successfully.
SaleCompleted implies SaleProductsResolved and StockDecreased occurred successfully.

LAW TerminalResult
Every action invocation terminates semantically as exactly one of Ok or Error.
